  {
    "id": 8,
    "documentId": "ajicshp0y9x5u1lvq1rkcpa9",
    "name": "Keinsy Gonzalez Ferro",
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "I recently used SCG Services to get rid of some old furniture and household garbage, and I couldn’t be happier with the experience! Damian and his team were on time, professional, and super efficient. They handled everything quickly, from an old couch and broken chairs to a pile of trash I had in my garage.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "What I appreciated most was their fair pricing and friendly attitude. They made the whole process stress-free, and the place looked spotless when they were done. If you need junk removal, these are the guys to call!",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "Highly recommend and will definitely use them again!",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
