  {
    "id": 10,
    "documentId": "y4f01f19e4eyb9tw7p6zazn6",
    "name": "Lilianny Segura Gonzalez",
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "I had a nightmare situation when my tenants moved out and left the place in horrible condition—trash everywhere, broken furniture, and an overwhelming mess. I was completely stressed out, but SCG Services came to the rescue!",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "Damian and his team were fast, professional, and incredibly thorough. They cleared out all the junk, hauled away the furniture, and even made sure the place was spotless. I was honestly shocked at how quickly they handled everything.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "Their pricing was fair, transparent, and totally worth it considering the amount of work they had to do. If you’re a landlord dealing with bad tenants, don’t even think twice—call SCG Services!",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "Highly recommend and will absolutely use them again!",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
